sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Codex @architect
  participant MA as ACS MCP bridge
  participant S as ACS/A2A
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant CA as Codex adapter
  participant B as Codex @backend

  A->>MA: acs_send(to=@backend, ...)
  MA->>S: bridge.attestCaller(_meta)
  S-->>MA: bound principal for @architect
  MA->>S: A2A SendMessage to @backend
  S->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
  S->>DB: task + message + event + intent + idempotency
  S->>DB: COMMIT
  S-->>MA: Task(state=submitted)
  MA-->>A: accepted task ID

  S->>DB: lease delivery intent
  S->>CA: deliver(binding epoch, neutral envelope)
  CA->>B: app-server turn/start + toolOutput
  B-->>CA: turn accepted
  CA-->>S: RuntimeDeliveryResult.accepted
  S->>DB: delivery accepted; task working

  B->>MA: acs_task_complete(taskId, result)
  MA->>S: attested executor callback
  S->>DB: append result + terminal event
  S->>DB: create origin notification
  S->>CA: deliver task-event to @architect
  CA->>A: app-server toolOutput
